Display:

    Display property used to how an element should be displayed in the UI or webpage.

    1.block:
    It will make the element start from new line.
    It will occupy entire parent width.
    We can customize the width.
    It will not allow other content in same line.

    2.inline:
    It will take only content width.
    It will allow other content in same line.
    We cannot customie the height, width and padding.

    3.inline-block:
    It will take only content width.
    It will allow other content in same line.
    We can customie the height, width and padding.
